#. type: Content of: <para>
#: blfs-en/xincludes/X11R6_symlink.xml:6
msgid ""
"This package (unfortunately) expects the <application>X Window</application>"
" system to be installed in the <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr/X11R6</filename> directory. If you're using a recent "
"version of <application>Xorg</application> and it is installed in any other "
"location, ensure you have followed the instructions in the <xref "
"linkend=\"X11R6-compat-symlink\"/> section."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote (infelizmente) espera que o sistema <application>Janelas X</"
"application> esteja instalado no diretório <filename class='directory'>/usr/"
"X11R6</filename>. Se você estiver usando uma versão recente do "
"<application>Xorg</application> e ela estiver instalada em qualquer outro "
"local, certifique-se de ter seguido as instruções na seção <xref linkend="
"\"X11R6-compat-symlink\"/>."
